Virtual desktop
Another type of virtual machine is Virtual desktop.
It allows you to use a version of an operating system such as windows on the cloud. It is accessible from anywhere.
It is secur in terms of users need to access the desktop using their microsoft entra accounts. Administrators can configure
granular role based access control and multi-factor authentication to further increase security and access control. 
It reduces the risk of confidential data being left on a physical device. 


